	'rewards_n2' => '1',
	'the_filter_intro' => 'Designed and built for calm daily use, the Shizuku Countertop Filter pairs a matte stone-grey ceramic housing with a 1.6 L glass carafe. It requires neither plumbing nor electricity, relying entirely on natural gravity.',
	'the_filter_h1' => 'Four Stages of Natural Filtration',
	'the_filter_b1_1' => 'Our custom cartridge uses four distinct layers to produce clearer water with less chlorine smell and improved fresh taste. First, water passes through a ceramic pre-filter that captures coarse suspended sediment and particulate matter. Second, granular activated carbon adsorbs compounds that cause harsh municipal tap flavours and chemical odours.',
